  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "哈，哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "整合运动这帮丧心病狂的家伙！居然用，居然用......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "那些野兽......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "是，是整合运动，布置的吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "感染的野兽，被整合运动当做士兵驱使......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "不，那不只是野兽那么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "我能感受到，那种......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "那不是单纯的野兽，它们比起野兽，更像我们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "杜宾教官......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "头儿......我们，该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "帮它们从痛苦中解脱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "头儿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "战斗已经结束了，杜宾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "我们同样也和整合运动发生了冲突。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "天灾已经盘旋在我们头顶，随时都可能坠落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "即使是切尔诺伯格城，在天灾的直接冲击下，也会化作一摊废墟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "整合运动在这个时候闹事，确实会制造更大的混乱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "杜宾，没时间了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "罗德岛能躲过整合运动的袭击，也能瞒着乌萨斯帝国行动，但面对天灾，我们终归是脆弱的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "够了，走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "无论整合运动的计划有多疯狂，对于我们来说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "各位的安全才是最重要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "整合运动的领袖，可能把这次的事件看作一个标志，一种手段......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "对我来说，只是罗德岛的处境，变得越来越危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "在这个时间点挑起事端——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "整合运动不是足够狠毒，就是足够疯狂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "也许，两者兼有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
